{% doc %}
  Privacy policy page for Signs ByLITA, written from the November 2026 review copy.
{% enddoc %}
<article class="sbl-info">
  {% render 'sbl-info-hero',
    eyebrow: 'Legal',
    title: 'Privacy policy',
    text: 'What information we collect when you shop with Signs ByLITA, how we use it, and the choices you have.',
    aside_label: '',
    aside_text: ''
  %}
  <div class="sbl-info-body">
    <p class="sbl-info-updated">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <nav class="sbl-info-jump" aria-label="Privacy policy sections">
      <a href="#collect">What we collect</a>
      <a href="#use">How we use it</a>
      <a href="#share">Who we share it with</a>
      <a href="#cookies">Cookies and advertising</a>
      <a href="#choices">Your choices and rights</a>
      <a href="#privacy-contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Signs ByLITA (signsbylita.com) is operated by Pacific Sign and Stamp, Inc., part of the LITA family of brands, based in Signal Hill, California ("Signs ByLITA", "we", "us"). This policy explains how we handle personal information when you visit our website, use our sign designer, place an order or contact us. By using our website, you agree to this policy.</p>

    <h2 id="collect">Information we collect</h2>
    <h3>Information you give us</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Order details — name, shipping and billing address, email, phone number and the products you buy.</li>
      <li>Your designs — the wording, logos, images and choices you enter in our sign designer to create your order.</li>
      <li>Account details — if you create an account, your login details and order history.</li>
      <li>Messages — what you send us through our contact form, bulk quote form, email or phone.</li>
      <li>Marketing preferences — if you sign up for our emails.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Payment information</h3>
    <p>Payments are processed securely by our payment providers (such as Shopify Payments, Shop Pay, PayPal and Google Pay). We do not see or store your full card number.</p>
    <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
    <p>When you browse our website we automatically collect information such as your IP address, browser and device type, approximate location, the pages you view, the products you look at, how you arrived on our site, and search terms you use. We collect this using cookies and similar technologies (see Cookies and advertising below).</p>

    <h2 id="use">How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To make, ship and deliver your order, and to send order and shipping updates.</li>
      <li>To provide customer support and answer your questions and quote requests.</li>
      <li>To run and improve our website and sign designer, and understand what customers are looking for.</li>
      <li>To send you marketing emails, if you have opted in. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
      <li>To show you relevant ads on other websites and social media, and measure how our ads perform.</li>
      <li>To prevent fraud, keep our website secure, and comply with legal, tax and accounting obligations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="share">Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information for money. We share it only as needed to run our business:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Service providers — our e-commerce platform (Shopify), payment processors, shipping carriers, email and customer service tools, and the provider of our online sign designer.</li>
      <li>Advertising and analytics partners — such as Google, Meta (Facebook and Instagram) and Microsoft (Bing), which help us understand site usage and show you relevant ads.</li>
      <li>Our LITA family of brands — the related companies that help us fulfil orders and provide support.</li>
      <li>Legal and safety — when required by law, to respond to legal requests, to protect our rights, or to prevent fraud.</li>
      <li>Business transfers — if our business is sold or merged, customer information may be transferred to the new owner.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="cookies">Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small files stored on your device. We use them to keep items in your cart, remember your preferences, understand how our website is used, and show you relevant ads. Some cookies are set by our partners, such as Google Analytics, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and Microsoft Advertising, which may collect information about your activity across websites over time.</p>
    <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, though some parts of our site (like the cart) may not work properly without them. You can also limit personalized ads through Google Ad Settings, your Facebook ad preferences, and the industry opt-out page at <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">optout.aboutads.info</a>. Where available, we honor the Global Privacy Control (GPC) signal from your browser as an opt-out of the "sharing" of your information for targeted advertising.</p>

    <h2 id="choices">Your choices and rights</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Marketing emails — use the unsubscribe link in any email, or contact us.</li>
      <li>Your account — you can review and update your details by logging in to your account.</li>
      <li>Access, correction and deletion — you can ask us for a copy of the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it (we may need to keep some records, such as order and tax records, where the law requires).</li>
    </ul>
    <h3 id="do-not-sell">California residents</h3>
    <p>If you live in California, the California Consumer Privacy Act (as amended by the CPRA) gives you the right to know what personal information we collect, use and disclose; to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information; to opt out of the "sale" or "sharing" of your personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising; and to limit the use of sensitive personal information. We do not sell personal information for money, but use of advertising cookies may count as "sharing" under California law. To opt out, use the "Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information" link in our website footer or enable Global Privacy Control in your browser. We will not discriminate against you for exercising these rights. Residents of other U.S. states with similar privacy laws may make the same requests.</p>
    <p>To make a request, contact us or email us at the address below. We will verify your request before responding and reply within the time required by law. You may use an authorized agent to make a request on your behalf.</p>

    <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
    <p>We keep your information for as long as needed to fulfil your orders, provide support, and meet legal, tax and accounting requirements, and then delete or anonymize it. We use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect your information, but no website or online transmission is 100% secure.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Our website is intended for adults and businesses. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has given us personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>

    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>Our website links to other sites, including our sister brands and social media. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we'll change the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Significant changes will be highlighted on our website.</p>

    <h2 id="privacy-contact">Contact us</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy or your information? Get in touch:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Online: <a href="/pages/contact-us">signsbylita.com/pages/contact-us</a></li>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@signsbylita.com">info@signsbylita.com</a></li>
      <li>Phone: <a href="tel:3105341138">(310) 534-1138</a></li>
      <li>Mail: Signs ByLITA, 2776 Gundry Ave, Signal Hill, CA 90755</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</article>
